#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1409
msgid "Zone:"
msgstr "Zona:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1436
msgid ""
"Banking-aware filter. CPU view = whatever PC sees now. Specific zone = only "
"when the bank is paged in."
msgstr ""
"Filtro consciente del banking. Vista CPU = lo que PC ve ahora. Zona "
"específica = solo cuando el banco está mapeado activamente."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1442
msgid "Bank ID (hex):"
msgstr "ID de banco (hex):"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1453
msgid "Bank Match Mode:"
msgstr "Modo de coincidencia de banco:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1455
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact bank ID (default).\n"
"Range  = trigger when active bank within [Bank ID..End Bank].\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (bank & Mask) == (Bank ID & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for matching multiple overlay banks at once.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = disparar en ID de banco exacto (predeterminado).\n"
"Range  = disparar cuando el banco activo está en [Bank ID..End Bank].\n"
"Mask   = disparar cuando (bank & Mask) == (Bank ID & Mask).\n"
"         Útil para coincidir múltiples bancos overlay a la vez.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1465
msgid "End Bank:"
msgstr "Banco final:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1474
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1578
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1661
msgid ""
"Upper bound for RANGE match (inclusive). Active only when Match Mode = Range."
msgstr ""
"Límite superior para coincidencia RANGE (inclusivo). Activo solo cuando "
"Match Mode = Range."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1480
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1585
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1667
msgid "Mask:"
msgstr "Máscara:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1489
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Example: Bank=0x08, Mask=0x18 triggers on banks 8, "
"9, 10, 11 (= 0x08..0x0B with high bits cleared).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Máscara AND para coincidencia MASK. Ejemplo: Bank=0x08, Mask=0x18 dispara en "
"bancos 8, 9, 10, 11 (= 0x08..0x0B con bits altos limpiados).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1497
msgid "Address as:"
msgstr "Dirección como:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1503
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1513
msgid "Bank offset"
msgstr "Desplazamiento de banco"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1503
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1506
msgid "CPU view"
msgstr "Vista de CPU"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1522
msgid ""
"CPU view = Address is a Z80 address (0000-FFFF).\n"
"Bank offset = Address is an offset within the PEHU bank (0000-1FFF), matched "
"wherever the bank is mapped.\n"
"PEHU memext only."
msgstr ""
"Vista de CPU = la dirección es una dirección Z80 (0000-FFFF).\n"
"Desplazamiento de banco = la dirección es un desplazamiento dentro del banco "
"PEHU (0000-1FFF), coincidido dondequiera que el banco esté mapeado.\n"
"Solo PEHU memext."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1537
#: src/ui-imgui/memext/memext_load_dialog.cpp:128
msgid "Offset:"
msgstr "Desplazamiento:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1537
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_disassembled.cpp:1641
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_focus_to.cpp:211
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/watch/watch_window.cpp:464
msgid "Address:"
msgstr "Dirección:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1546
msgid "Offset within the PEHU bank (0000-1FFF)."
msgstr "Desplazamiento dentro del banco PEHU (0000-1FFF)."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1547
msgid ""
"CPU address for PC_EXEC, memory address for MEM_R/W. For MEM range use End "
"Addr below as well."
msgstr ""
"Dirección CPU para PC_EXEC, dirección de memoria para MEM_R/W. Para rango "
"MEM use también End Addr abajo."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1556
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1640
msgid "Match Mode:"
msgstr "Modo de coincidencia:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1558
msgid ""
"Single = trigger only on exact value (default V1 behavior).\n"
"Range  = trigger when value is within [Address..End Addr] inclusive.\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (value & Mask) == (Address & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for groups of addresses sharing a bit pattern.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = disparar solo en valor exacto (comportamiento predeterminado V1).\n"
"Range  = disparar cuando el valor está en [Address..End Addr] inclusivo.\n"
"Mask   = disparar cuando (value & Mask) == (Address & Mask).\n"
"         Útil para grupos de direcciones compartiendo un patrón de bits.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1569
msgid "End Addr:"
msgstr "Dir. final:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1594
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Trigger when (value & Mask) == (Address & Mask). "
"Example: Address=0x0042, Mask=0x00FF triggers on any address with low byte "
"0x42 (0x0042, 0x0142, ...). Default 0xFFFF = identical to Single mode. Note: "
"PC_EXEC MASK is V1.5.E-limited (fallback to ref addr only) - use MEM_R/W for "
"full mask support.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Máscara AND para coincidencia MASK. Disparar cuando (value & Mask) == "
"(Address & Mask). Ejemplo: Address=0x0042, Mask=0x00FF dispara en cualquier "
"dirección con byte bajo 0x42 (0x0042, 0x0142, ...). Predeterminado 0xFFFF = "
"idéntico al modo Single. Nota: PC_EXEC MASK está limitado en V1.5.E "
"(fallback solo a dirección ref) - use MEM_R/W para soporte completo de "
"máscara.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1610
msgid "Port Mode:"
msgstr "Modo de puerto:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1612
msgid ""
"Port Mode:\n"
"  8-bit  = IN A,(n) / OUT (n),A pattern (port literal 0..0xFF, B register on "
"bus is don't care).\n"
"  16-bit = IN r,(C) / OUT (C),r pattern (port = full BC register 0..0xFFFF, "
"B = high, C = low).\n"
"Default 8-bit covers most Z80 software. 16-bit needed for hardware that "
"decodes B as part of port address.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Modo de puerto:\n"
"  8-bit  = patrón IN A,(n) / OUT (n),A (puerto literal 0..0xFF, registro B "
"en bus es don't care).\n"
"  16-bit = patrón IN r,(C) / OUT (C),r (puerto = registro BC completo "
"0..0xFFFF, B = alto, C = bajo).\n"
"Predeterminado 8-bit cubre la mayoría del software Z80. 16-bit necesario "
"para hardware que decodifica B como parte de la dirección de puerto.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1626
msgid "Port:"
msgstr "Puerto:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1634
msgid ""
"Z80 I/O port value. Width follows Port Mode (8-bit = 0..0xFF, 16-bit = "
"0..0xFFFF where B = high, C = low byte). In 8-bit mode upper byte of input "
"is ignored at runtime."
msgstr ""
"Valor de puerto Z80 I/O. Ancho sigue el Modo de puerto (8-bit = 0..0xFF, 16-"
"bit = 0..0xFFFF donde B = alto, C = byte bajo). En modo 8-bit el byte "
"superior de la entrada se ignora en tiempo de ejecución."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1642
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact port (default).\n"
"Range  = trigger when port within [Port..End Port].\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (port & Mask) == (Port & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for I/O port group matching (e.g. 0xCC..0xCF).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = disparar en puerto exacto (predeterminado).\n"
"Range  = disparar cuando el puerto está en [Port..End Port].\n"
"Mask   = disparar cuando (port & Mask) == (Port & Mask).\n"
"         Útil para coincidir grupos de puertos I/O (p.ej. 0xCC..0xCF).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1652
msgid "End Port:"
msgstr "Puerto final:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1676
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Example: Port=0xCC, Mask=0xFC triggers on 0xCC, "
"0xCD, 0xCE, 0xCF.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Máscara AND para coincidencia MASK. Ejemplo: Port=0xCC, Mask=0xFC dispara en "
"0xCC, 0xCD, 0xCE, 0xCF.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1685
msgid "Event:"
msgstr "Evento:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1691
msgid "(select event)"
msgstr "(seleccione evento)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1696
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/ctc_window.cpp:356
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/eventview/event_viewer_window.cpp:1982
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/pioz80_window.cpp:424
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/pioz80_window.cpp:471
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/ppi_window.cpp:406
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_stack_panel.cpp:1302
msgid "(none)"
msgstr "(ninguno)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1749
msgid ""
"Hardware event to monitor. Categorized:\n"
"  Signal - 0/1 line with trigger condition (Low/High/Rising/Falling/"
"Changed)\n"
"  Change - fires on every change (mode, palette, palgrp, border)\n"
"  Point  - parametrized (raster:N) or one-shot (CPU events)\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/hw-events.md"
msgstr ""
"Evento hardware a monitorear. Categorizado:\n"
"  Signal - línea 0/1 con condición de disparador (Low/High/Rising/Falling/"
"Changed)\n"
"  Change - dispara en cada cambio (mode, palette, palgrp, border)\n"
"  Point  - parametrizado (raster:N) o de un solo disparo (eventos CPU)\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/hw-events.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1759
msgid "Trigger:"
msgstr "Disparador:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1798
msgid ""
"Trigger condition (only for Signal events):\n"
"  0 (Low)   - fires while signal level is low\n"
"  1 (High)  - fires while signal level is high\n"
"  Rising    - fires on 0->1 transition\n"
"  Falling   - fires on 1->0 transition\n"
"  Changed   - fires on any transition\n"
"Default Rising preserves legacy 'fire-on-event' behavior.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/hw-events.md"
msgstr ""
"Condición de disparador (solo para eventos Signal):\n"
"  0 (Low)   - dispara mientras el nivel de señal es bajo\n"
"  1 (High)  - dispara mientras el nivel de señal es alto\n"
"  Rising    - dispara en transición 0->1\n"
"  Falling   - dispara en transición 1->0\n"
"  Changed   - dispara en cualquier transición\n"
"Predeterminado Rising preserva el comportamiento legacy 'fire-on-event'.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/hw-events.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1813
msgid "Param:"
msgstr "Parámetro:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1828
#, c-format
msgid "(scanline 0..%u)"
msgstr "(scanline 0..%u)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1840
msgid "Lower bound:"
msgstr "Límite inferior:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1840
msgid "SP Threshold:"
msgstr "Umbral SP:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1850
msgid ""
"SINGLE: SP value to cross down (stack overflow detect).\n"
"WINDOW: Lower bound of allowed SP range."
msgstr ""
"SINGLE: Valor SP a cruzar hacia abajo (detección de stack overflow).\n"
"WINDOW: Límite inferior del rango SP permitido."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1854
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2425
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/heatmap/mhmap_window.cpp:665
#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/watch/watch_window.cpp:443
msgid "Mode:"
msgstr "Modo:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1856
msgid ""
"Single = trigger when SP descends through SP Threshold (stack overflow "
"detect, default V1).\n"
"Window = trigger when SP leaves [Lower..Upper] range (stack corruption / "
"cross-task switch detect).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = disparar cuando SP desciende a través del Umbral SP (detección "
"stack overflow, predeterminado V1).\n"
"Window = disparar cuando SP sale del rango [Lower..Upper] (detección de "
"corrupción de pila / cambio entre tareas).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1866
msgid "Upper bound:"
msgstr "Límite superior:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1875
msgid ""
"Upper SP value of the allowed window. Lower = SP Threshold. Trigger fires on "
"transition from inside [Lower..Upper] to outside. Edge-triggered: pre-"
"existing outside SP at startup will not spam - waits for transition.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"
msgstr ""
"Valor SP superior de la ventana permitida. Lower = Umbral SP. El disparador "
"se activa en transición desde dentro [Lower..Upper] hacia fuera. Edge-"
"triggered: SP preexistente fuera al inicio no hará spam - espera "
"transición.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/match-modes.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1901
msgid "IRQ - CPU acknowledged INT (post-dispatch)"
msgstr "IRQ - INT reconocido por CPU (post-dispatch)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1905
msgid "IM modes:"
msgstr "Modos IM:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1908
msgid "IM 0##bpt_irq_im0_en"
msgstr "IM 0##bpt_irq_im0_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1912
msgid "IM 1##bpt_irq_im1_en"
msgstr "IM 1##bpt_irq_im1_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1916
msgid "IM 2##bpt_irq_im2_en"
msgstr "IM 2##bpt_irq_im2_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1920
msgid ""
"Choose Z80 interrupt modes to monitor. At least one must be selected. BP "
"fires only when CPU dispatches in an enabled mode. Each enabled IM mode "
"reveals its own sub-filter section below.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Elija modos de interrupción Z80 a monitorear. Al menos uno debe estar "
"seleccionado. BP dispara solo cuando CPU hace dispatch en un modo "
"habilitado. Cada modo IM habilitado revela su propia sección de sub-filtro "
"abajo.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1934
msgid "IM 0 RST filter (none = match all):"
msgstr "Filtro RST IM 0 (ninguno = coincidir todos):"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1936
msgid ""
"Filter triggers by RST opcode pushed on the bus during IM 0 dispatch. Empty "
"(no checkbox set) = match all RSTs (legacy V1 behavior). Mask bit i matches "
"RST opcode (0xC7 + i*8).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Filtra disparos por opcode RST puesto en el bus durante dispatch IM 0. Vacío "
"(sin checkbox marcado) = coincidir todos los RST (comportamiento legacy V1). "
"Bit i de máscara coincide con opcode RST (0xC7 + i*8).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1995
msgid "IM 1 always dispatches RST 38h (no extra filter)"
msgstr "IM 1 siempre hace dispatch de RST 38h (sin filtro extra)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:1997
msgid ""
"In IM 1 the Z80 always dispatches via RST 38h. There are no per-vector or "
"per-source sub-filters available - if IM 1 is enabled, every IM 1 dispatch "
"will fire the BP (subject to other BP rules - condition, hits, skip).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"En IM 1 el Z80 siempre hace dispatch vía RST 38h. No hay sub-filtros por "
"vector o por fuente disponibles - si IM 1 está habilitado, cada dispatch IM "
"1 disparará el BP (sujeto a otras reglas BP - condition, hits, skip).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2013
msgid "IM 2 sub-filters:"
msgstr "Sub-filtros IM 2:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2020
msgid "Filter by IM2 vector address##bpt_irq_vec_en"
msgstr "Filtrar por dirección de vector IM2##bpt_irq_vec_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2023
msgid ""
"Filter triggers only when CPU dispatches IM2 INT through this exact vector "
"slot. Vector address is computed as (I register << 8) | (low byte from "
"peripheral & 0xFE). Comparison applies AND with 0xFE on bit 0 (= HW vector "
"page boundary), so user value bit 0 is ignored at runtime.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Filtra disparos solo cuando CPU hace dispatch de IM2 INT a través de este "
"slot de vector exacto. La dirección de vector se calcula como (registro I << "
"8) | (byte bajo del periférico & 0xFE). La comparación aplica AND con 0xFE "
"en bit 0 (= límite de página de vector HW), por lo que el bit 0 del valor de "
"usuario se ignora en runtime.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2035
msgid "IM2 Vector:"
msgstr "Vector IM2:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2051
msgid "Vector Match Mode:"
msgstr "Modo coincidencia vector:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2054
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact vector address (default V1.5).\n"
"Range  = trigger when vector within [Vector..End] inclusive.\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (vector & Mask) == (Vector & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for matching vector page slots.\n"
"Note: HW page boundary mask 0xFFFE is applied to both user value and runtime "
"vector before comparison.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = disparar en dirección de vector exacta (predeterminado V1.5).\n"
"Range  = disparar cuando el vector está en [Vector..End] inclusivo.\n"
"Mask   = disparar cuando (vector & Mask) == (Vector & Mask).\n"
"         Útil para coincidir slots de página de vector.\n"
"Nota: La máscara de límite de página HW 0xFFFE se aplica al valor de usuario "
"y al vector runtime antes de la comparación.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2066
msgid "Vector End:"
msgstr "Fin vector:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2076
msgid ""
"Upper bound for RANGE match (inclusive). Active only when Vector Match Mode "
"= Range."
msgstr ""
"Límite superior para coincidencia RANGE (inclusivo). Activo solo cuando "
"Vector Match Mode = Range."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2082
msgid "Vector Mask:"
msgstr "Máscara vector:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2092
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Trigger when (vector & Mask) == (Vector & Mask). "
"Default 0xFFFF = identical to Single mode. Example: Vector=0xFE10, "
"Mask=0xFFE0 triggers on any vector in 0xFE00..0xFE1F page slot range."
msgstr ""
"Máscara AND para coincidencia MASK. Disparar cuando (vector & Mask) == "
"(Vector & Mask). Predeterminado 0xFFFF = idéntico al modo Single. Ejemplo: "
"Vector=0xFE10, Mask=0xFFE0 dispara en cualquier vector en el rango de slot "
"de página 0xFE00..0xFE1F."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2105
msgid "Filter by IM2 ISR address##bpt_irq_isr_en"
msgstr "Filtrar por dirección IM2 ISR##bpt_irq_isr_en"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2108
msgid ""
"Filter triggers only when CPU jumps to this ISR after IM2 dispatch. ISR "
"address is read by CPU from the IM2 vector table during dispatch.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Filtra disparos solo cuando CPU salta a este ISR después de dispatch IM2. La "
"dirección ISR es leída por CPU desde la tabla de vectores IM2 durante el "
"dispatch.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2114
msgid "IM2 ISR:"
msgstr "IM2 ISR:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2128
msgid "ISR Match Mode:"
msgstr "Modo coincidencia ISR:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2131
msgid ""
"Single = trigger on exact ISR address (default V1.5).\n"
"Range  = trigger when ISR within [ISR..End] inclusive.\n"
"Mask   = trigger when (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask).\n"
"         Useful for matching ISR memory regions.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"
msgstr ""
"Single = disparar en dirección ISR exacta (predeterminado V1.5).\n"
"Range  = disparar cuando ISR está en [ISR..End] inclusivo.\n"
"Mask   = disparar cuando (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask).\n"
"         Útil para coincidir regiones de memoria ISR.\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-filter.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2141
msgid "ISR End:"
msgstr "Fin ISR:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2151
msgid ""
"Upper bound for RANGE match (inclusive). Active only when ISR Match Mode = "
"Range."
msgstr ""
"Límite superior para coincidencia RANGE (inclusivo). Activo solo cuando ISR "
"Match Mode = Range."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2157
msgid "ISR Mask:"
msgstr "Máscara ISR:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2167
msgid ""
"AND mask for MASK match. Trigger when (isr & Mask) == (ISR & Mask). Default "
"0xFFFF = identical to Single mode."
msgstr ""
"Máscara AND para coincidencia MASK. Disparar cuando (isr & Mask) == (ISR & "
"Mask). Predeterminado 0xFFFF = idéntico al modo Single."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2188
msgid "IRQ_SIG - peripheral INT line raise (pre-dispatch)"
msgstr "IRQ_SIG - elevación de línea INT periférica (pre-dispatch)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2192
msgid "Sources:"
msgstr "Fuentes:"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2196
msgid "(at least one required, OR semantics)"
msgstr "(al menos uno requerido, semántica OR)"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2198
msgid ""
"Choose peripheral INT line sources to monitor (pre-dispatch). PIOZ80 PORT_A/"
"B = Z80 PIO chip interrupts. CTC2 = CTC channel 2 (timer/counter). FDC = "
"floppy disk controller (WD279x). Other = other unrecognized INT sources (bus "
"latch). Multi-source BP fires when ANY selected source raises (OR "
"semantics).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-sig.md"
msgstr ""
"Elija fuentes de líneas INT periféricas a monitorear (pre-dispatch). PIOZ80 "
"PORT_A/B = interrupciones del chip Z80 PIO. CTC2 = canal CTC 2 (timer/"
"counter). FDC = controlador de disquete (WD279x). Other = otras fuentes INT "
"no reconocidas (bus latch). BP multi-fuente dispara cuando CUALQUIER fuente "
"seleccionada se eleva (semántica OR).\n"
"Reference: docs/cz/debugger/breakpoints/irq-sig.md"

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/breakpoints/bpt_edit_panel.cpp:2266
msgid "Global BP - fires when condition is true (per-instruction probe)"
msgstr ""
"BP global - dispara cuando la condición es true (sonda por instrucción)"

