#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/ioview/io_window.cpp:1894
msgid ""
"Filter syntax (boolean expression):\n"
"Atoms (leaf tokens):\n"
"  port:CE       low byte match (8-bit IORQ, ignores random B reg)\n"
"  port:C0-CF    low byte range\n"
"  port16:00CE   full 16-bit match (explicit BC pattern)\n"
"  port16:CF00-CF0F  16-bit range\n"
"  pc:4042 / pc:4000-40FF          PC match / range\n"
"  value:42 / value:00-7F          value match / range\n"
"  frame:>100 / frame:<100 / frame:50-150\n"
"  cycle:>1000000 / cycle:1000-2000\n"
"  addr:E008 / addr:E000-E008      MMIO address match / range\n"
"  in / out      IORQ direction\n"
"  mr / mw       MMIO direction\n"
"  text          name substring (case-insensitive)\n"
"Operators (high to low precedence):\n"
"  ( )           grouping\n"
"  !             NOT (over leaf or parenthesized expression)\n"
"  space & AND   AND (AND keyword is uppercase only)\n"
"  | OR          OR  (OR keyword is uppercase only)\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  port:CE pc:4042            both must match\n"
"  port:CE | port:CF          either port\n"
"  (port:CE pc:42) | port:CF  group OR group\n"
"  !(in | out)                neither IN nor OUT"
msgstr ""
"Sintaxis del filtro (expresión booleana):\n"
"Átomos (tokens hoja):\n"
"  port:CE       coincidencia byte bajo (8-bit IORQ, ignora reg B aleatorio)\n"
"  port:C0-CF    rango byte bajo\n"
"  port16:00CE   coincidencia 16-bit completa (patrón BC explícito)\n"
"  port16:CF00-CF0F  rango 16-bit\n"
"  pc:4042 / pc:4000-40FF          coincidencia PC / rango\n"
"  value:42 / value:00-7F          coincidencia valor / rango\n"
"  frame:>100 / frame:<100 / frame:50-150\n"
"  cycle:>1000000 / cycle:1000-2000\n"
"  addr:E008 / addr:E000-E008      coincidencia dirección MMIO / rango\n"
"  in / out      dirección IORQ\n"
"  mr / mw       dirección MMIO\n"
"  text          subcadena de nombre (sin distinguir mayúsculas)\n"
"Operadores (de mayor a menor precedencia):\n"
"  ( )           agrupación\n"
"  !             NOT (sobre hoja o expresión entre paréntesis)\n"
"  espacio & AND AND (palabra clave AND solo en mayúsculas)\n"
"  | OR          OR  (palabra clave OR solo en mayúsculas)\n"
"Ejemplos:\n"
"  port:CE pc:4042            ambos deben coincidir\n"
"  port:CE | port:CF          cualquiera de los puertos\n"
"  (port:CE pc:42) | port:CF  grupo OR grupo\n"
"  !(in | out)                ni IN ni OUT"

