"desde el último Reset. = suma de la columna Calls."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1178
msgid ""
"How many of 'Calls' were IRQ or NMI accept events\n"
"(= IM 0 / IM 1 / IM 2 / NMI, not CALL or RST)."
msgstr ""
"Cuántas de las 'Calls' fueron eventos de aceptación IRQ o NMI\n"
"(= IM 0 / IM 1 / IM 2 / NMI, no CALL o RST)."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1188
msgid ""
"RET / RETI / RETN events with no paired CALL in shadow\n"
"stack ('divergent returns').\n"
"\n"
"Causes:\n"
"  - PUSH addr + RET trampoline (BDOS dispatch tables)\n"
"  - longjmp pattern (restore SP and RET)\n"
"  - self-modifying return address on stack\n"
"  - ISR ending with RET instead of RETI\n"
"\n"
"Profiler skips these in aggregation (no paired enter).\n"
"\n"
"0 or a few = OK, data trustworthy.\n"
"Growing steadily = multi-stack OS pattern (CP/M, NIPOS)\n"
"= V1 measurements NOT accurate, waiting on callstack\n"
"V1.5+ scope BPs."
msgstr ""
"Eventos RET / RETI / RETN sin CALL emparejado en la pila shadow\n"
"('retornos divergentes').\n"
"\n"
"Causas:\n"
"  - trampolín PUSH dir + RET (tablas dispatch BDOS)\n"
"  - patrón longjmp (restaurar SP y RET)\n"
"  - dirección de retorno auto-modificable en la pila\n"
"  - ISR terminando con RET en lugar de RETI\n"
"\n"
"Profiler los omite en agregación (sin enter emparejado).\n"
"\n"
"0 o unos pocos = OK, datos confiables.\n"
"Creciendo constantemente = patrón OS multi-stack (CP/M, NIPOS)\n"
"= mediciones V1 NO precisas, esperando callstack\n"
"V1.5+ scope BPs."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1211
msgid ""
"Unique (target_addr, kind) entries in the aggregator.\n"
"Each bucket = one row in the table.\n"
"\n"
"A bucket is created at first entry to that\n"
"(address, kind) combination. Cleared only by Reset.\n"
"\n"
"Typical Z80 game / demo: tens to hundreds.\n"
"Thousands and growing = SMC or banked code mixing\n"
"into the same buckets, data may be misleading.\n"
"\n"
"Memory cost: ~64 B per bucket."
msgstr ""
"Entradas únicas (target_addr, kind) en el agregador.\n"
"Cada bucket = una fila en la tabla.\n"
"\n"
"Un bucket se crea en la primera entrada a esa\n"
"combinación (dirección, tipo). Se limpia solo con Reset.\n"
"\n"
"Juego / demo Z80 típico: decenas a cientos.\n"
"Miles y creciendo = SMC o código bancado mezclando\n"
"en los mismos buckets, los datos pueden ser engañosos.\n"
"\n"
"Coste de memoria: ~64 B por bucket."

#: src/ui-imgui/debugger/sections/dbg_profiler.cpp:1233
msgid ""
"Parallel stack push beyond PROFILER_MAX_DEPTH (256).\n"
"Extreme nesting depth - shouldn't happen in normal Z80\n"
"code. Investigate or Reset."
msgstr ""
"Push de pila paralela más allá de PROFILER_MAX_DEPTH (256).\n"
"Profundidad de anidamiento extrema - no debería ocurrir en código\n"
"Z80 normal. Investigue o haga Reset."

